{"type":"message","id":"9402e47b","parentId":"e854f289","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:01:14.091Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No SSH, no gh CLI, no credential helpers configured. The git push over SSH is failing because `ssh` binary is not available in this container environment. This is a cron task running in a limited container context without SSH access.\n\nI should report the failure back. The cron task already tried to commit, but the push failed. The changes are committed locally but can't be pushed. \n\nLet me check if there's any way to work around this, or if I should just report the failure. There's no way to push without SSH or gh CLI in this environment.\n\nLet me inform the user about the situation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n备份失败：`ssh` 不可用，无法 push 到 GitHub。\n\n**当前状态：**\n- ✅ `git add` + `git commit` 成功（更改已暂存并提交到本地）\n- ❌ `git push` 失败：`ssh: No such file or directory`\n\n**需要修复：**\nBoss 需要在 cron 环境里配置 SSH 或安装 `gh` CLI 才能推送。容器/环境中缺少 `ssh` 二进制文件。\n\n---\n\n如果 boss 能提供以下任一方式，我可以立即重试：\n1. **HTTPS 远程地址**（把 `git@github.com:` 换成 `https://github.com/`）\n2. **安装 ssh 到容器** / 在 cron 环境暴露 ssh\n\n或者这个备份任务暂时跳过，等 boss 配置好再说。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":13532,"output":284,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14088,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779321655398,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e7fde2c6-cd68-4288-bf85-e63b2cc010ce"}}
